ered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SyCEHetF0SicyI41Sib0QTehbybYcxE7pl8icHufDpWgEJWKlyiaN14l5KBMn98KyWvA88SaJF6YUnuQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;height: auto !important;vertical-align: bottom;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;'/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2021年，我们第一次接触到Halo批次的瑰夏，今年我们有3个批次，分别是卡杜拉，卡杜艾与瑰夏。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          卡杜拉这支它的发酵感非常轻，相比我们喝过的卡杜拉它的甜感和果汁感尤为突出。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          目前还没有查到这支卡杜拉来自哪个庄园，Savage官网有的2020年的竞拍记录里的卡杜拉是来自于Santa Maria庄园，在Savage的Instagram上面找到一小段视屏，Savage先生提到2022产季的卡杜拉采用的是传统的日晒处理方式，他们的生长海拔介于1600 - 1900米之间。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"